B. tension spring (flexure carriage), AlSiC/Ti housing
  rate 800 N/mm: preload deflection 0.75 mm; 35 K x 0.5 ppm/K mismatch over 83 mm = 1.5 um -> dF 1.2 N (0.19%)
  rate 1200 N/mm: preload deflection 0.50 mm; 35 K x 0.5 ppm/K mismatch over 83 mm = 1.5 um -> dF 1.7 N (0.29%)
  glass stretch over 83 mm free span 108 um; stored energy 0.5*F*stretch = 33 mJ; cam work to release/apply ~F*stretch = 65 mJ
  5% spring stress relaxation over life: crease and pressure terms scale x1.05; bow term in budget uses dF

C. finger and backstop (gap h)
  h 5 um: 1 N on tensioned span ~93 um/N -> lands on skin at 0.054 N
  h 8 um: 1 N on tensioned span ~93 um/N -> lands on skin at 0.086 N
  1 N over r=4 mm on 0.2 mm skin E=1 MPa (confined, x3): 1.3 um extra -> total give ~h+1 um at 1 N
  particle 5 um proud: tent force 13.9 mN; Hertz sink into 1 MPa skin 291 um (>= particle size -> embeds)
  particle 10 um proud: tent force 27.8 mN; Hertz sink into 1 MPa skin 366 um (>= particle size -> embeds)
  particle 20 um proud: tent force 55.7 mN; Hertz sink into 1 MPa skin 461 um (>= particle size -> embeds)

D. servo/gas cushion budget
  leak spec: hold +1.5 Pa for 8 h with <=2 um piezo stroke -> R_leak >= 1.7e+12 Pa s/m3 (leak <= 3.11 mm3/h)
  stroke needs: thermal (gas+structure) 0.017 um/K x 20 K = 0.34 um; barometric 3600 Pa -> 0.18 um; gravity flip 2q -> 0.40 um
  capacitive mean-gap sensor: C = eps0 A/h = 22 nF; 1 nm of gap = 200 ppm of C = 0.0073 Pa

